## Mock/real toggle convention (demo flavor)

See [docs/mock-vs-real.md](docs/mock-vs-real.md) — every external
integration in a `demo`-flavor project gets a Source switch (mock vs real)
in the UI, normalized to one response shape in the backend. Follow
MokapiExample's pattern: the normalization layer is what lets the frontend
stay ignorant of which source answered.
